# ValierShop.shop (CLEANED for ValierUO)
# - Removes duplicate Convenience (Carry) category block
# - Keeps weight-reduction bags under Convenience (Weight)
# - Keeps Pack Mule items under Convenience (Carry)
# - Renames Pack Mule labels to (+Carry) to match your pure carry-capacity system
#
# Format:
#   category|Category Name
#   item|DisplayName|TypeName|Amount|Price|Hue|Description
#
# Notes:
# - Price is in Valier wallet coins (account-bound).
# - TypeName can be short or fully qualified.

category|Crafting Packs
item|Basic Blacksmith Pack|BasicSmithPack|1|5|0|Tools + starter ingots
item|Basic Tailor Pack|BasicTailorPack|1|4|0|Tools + starter cloth/leather

category|Adventure Packs
item|Basic Adventurer Pack|BasicAdventurerPack|1|5|0|Bandages, food, basic supplies
item|Basic Mage Reagent Pack|BasicMageReagentPack|1|6|0|Starter reagents

category|Boosters
item|Loot Booster (30m)|LootBoostToken30m|1|5|0|+Loot chance for 30 minutes
item|Loot Booster (60m)|LootBoostToken60m|1|9|0|+Loot chance for 60 minutes
item|Fame Booster (30m)|FameBoostToken30m|1|5|0|+Fame gain for 30 minutes
item|Fame Booster (60m)|FameBoostToken60m|1|9|0|+Fame gain for 60 minutes
item|Skill Gain Booster (30m)|SkillGainBoostToken30m|1|8|0|+Skill gain for 30 minutes
item|Skill Gain Booster (60m)|SkillGainBoostToken60m|1|14|0|+Skill gain for 60 minutes

category|Convenience (Weight)
item|Ingot Satchel (75% reduction)|ValierIngotSatchel|1|8|0|Only holds ingots; reduces their weight
item|Ore Satchel (75% reduction)|ValierOreSatchel|1|8|0|Only holds ore/granite; reduces their weight
item|Lumber Satchel (75% reduction)|ValierLumberSatchel|1|8|0|Only holds logs/boards; reduces their weight
item|Tradesman's Backpack (65% reduction)|ValierTradesmanBackpack|1|12|0|General backpack; reduces weight of contents

category|Convenience (Carry)
item|Pack Mule Sash (+Carry)|ValierPackMuleSash|1|10|0|Adds carry capacity (from ValierCarryCapacity.cfg)
item|Pack Mule Ring (+Carry)|ValierPackMuleRing|1|10|0|Adds carry capacity (from ValierCarryCapacity.cfg)
